# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads (it reads this file, not .dockerignore):
# the package source only, as for the image itself. A checkout can hold
# controlled-access data in its working tree; none of it may leave it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
